B.abl=new A.cb(B.i7,["How do I add a new donor?","Go to Donors \u2192 tap the + button \u2192 fill in donor details and tap Save. The donor will appear in your list immediately."],t.l)
B.abi=new A.cb(B.i7,["Can I edit a donation after saving?","Yes. Open the donation from the Donations screen, tap the edit icon in the top right, make changes, and tap Save."],t.l)
B.abj=new A.cb(B.i7,["How does a Payment Link work?","Go to Payment Links, fill in the amount and purpose, tap Generate. Share the link via WhatsApp, SMS, or Email directly from the app."],t.l)
B.abk=new A.cb(B.i7,["Is my data backed up automatically?","Yes. When Auto Backup is enabled (Settings \u2192 Backup & Sync), data is backed up to the cloud every night at midnight."],t.l)
